# Soc Ops Checklist & Workspace Rules

## ✅ Mandatory Checklist
- [ ] **Lint & Format**: `uv run ruff check .` & `uv run ruff format .`
- [ ] **Test**: `uv run pytest`
- [ ] **Build**: Check `pyproject.toml` metadata

## 🚀 Project Summary
Social Bingo (FastAPI + Jinja2 + Vanilla CSS/JS).
- `app/`: Logic (`main`, `models`, `game_logic`, `game_service`) + Frontend (`templates`, `static`).
- `tests/`: Pytest suite.
- `workshop/`: Lab guides.

## 📜 Rules
- Use only `app/static/css` utility classes.
- Maintain semantic HTML in templates.
- Map all endpoints to `models.py` Pydantic models.
- Use strict Python type hints.
